      "detailed_description": "<h1>The 007 First Light Path Tracing Update is now LIVE!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/7db21cb760a2570ad873334c3fb1f704.avif?t=1793979129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/7db21cb760a2570ad873334c3fb1f704.avif?t=1793979129 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with NVIDIA, we’re bringing a new level of lighting, reflections and detail to <strong>007 First Light</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve also updated the PC specs to reflect the Path Tracing update - be sure to check them before jumping in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the latest update and experience the game in a whole new light!</p></p><br><h1>007 First Light - Reviews!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/aff3dabd991af439209a43bf0a5cf499.avif?t=1793979129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/aff3dabd991af439209a43bf0a5cf499.webp?t=1793979129 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Get the Deluxe Edition now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6836e971b215d6695a6f984215bc3063.avif?t=1793979129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/6836e971b215d6695a6f984215bc3063.avif?t=1793979129 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate your espionage adventure with 007 First Light Deluxe Edition. Earn your number in style with 4 new outfits, 4 new gadget skins and a new weapon skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 outfits:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of the Dead </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Explorer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Anchor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentleman Operator   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon skin:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent’s Mark   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gleaming Pack, including 4 gadget skins:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Lighter </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Earphones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Phone </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Pen</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Check out the full year one content overview!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/746c828fbff234da8208a6bcfc112021.avif?t=1793979129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/746c828fbff234da8208a6bcfc112021.avif?t=1793979129 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Launch is just the beginning for 007 First Light.  <br>Year one  is packed with new Tac Sim missions, Bawma's return, new gadgets, photomode, and more.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world’s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/e384f5cad999233b64d27f61b9e62358.poster.avif?t=1793979129\" width=1170 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/e384f5cad999233b64d27f61b9e62358.mp4?t=1793979129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/c5901b61ea3ea8c9ef3c145fa3a17ac6.poster.avif?t=1793979129\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/c5901b61ea3ea8c9ef3c145fa3a17ac6.webm?t=1793979129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/c5901b61ea3ea8c9ef3c145fa3a17ac6.mp4?t=1793979129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/b63db1e6126819a70e5d0b58adad9b29.poster.avif?t=1793979129\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/b63db1e6126819a70e5d0b58adad9b29.webm?t=1793979129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/b63db1e6126819a70e5d0b58adad9b29.mp4?t=1793979129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/9